# Hacetral (FEM Layer)

## Purpose

Authority DSL compiler + RC binder for TI-Aura orchestration.

## Scope (Phase 0)

- Fn-teleport stub -> Authority DSL
- DSL validator (strict)
- RC binder stub

## Non-Goals (Phase 0)

- Full Mistral runtime
- Network fetch
- Training/finetune
